   "text": "用户态（rtshm-abi 定义 ioctl ABI）\nrtsh（RPC shell）· robot-py（PyO3）\nuser-test-{ipc, mbox, rpc, sched, bench, pbmt}\nov-rpc 客户端：REQ(ch0) / RESP(ch1) / URGENT(ch2)",
