   "text": "跨核共享内存窗（RCPU SRAM 起始）\n主域 0xC080_0000 · RP 本地别名 0x0（冷读快 ~7×，绕开 M2F 桥）\n窗口 0x19000 = busy + 3×Channel @+0x100（每 0x8200）",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rect-b",
   "originalText": "跨核共享内存窗（RCPU SRAM 起始）\n主域 0xC080_0000 · RP 本地别名 0x0（冷读快 ~7×，绕开 M2F 桥）\n窗口 0x19000 = busy + 3×Channel @+0x100（每 0x8200）",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
