   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "通道：REQ / RESP / URGENT（RingBuffer<128> × 256B）\n门铃一：AP 写 MSIP1 唤醒 hart1（rt-async）\n门铃二：RP 写 MSIP0 唤醒 hart0（StarryOS）",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rect-2c",
   "originalText": "通道：REQ / RESP / URGENT（RingBuffer<128> × 256B）\n门铃一：AP 写 MSIP1 唤醒 hart1（rt-async）\n门铃二：RP 写 MSIP0 唤醒 hart0（StarryOS）",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
